{"2393970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Human Host", "steam_appid": 2393970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zombie virus, airborne and with an incubation period lasting <strong>years</strong>, has suddenly swept across the entire world. Almost everyone is already infected. You are one of the rare few born immune to the pathogen. Do whatever it takes… <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Realistic physics collisions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outstanding hit feedback, and the armor no longer provides abstract defense values — instead, it physically covers the body surface to block incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/dd4d0b684dc45b3ac429adbbd8f9223a.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/dd4d0b684dc45b3ac429adbbd8f9223a.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/dd4d0b684dc45b3ac429adbbd8f9223a.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/b48b18dc5609e6c5ecf9a0a479640fa8.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/b48b18dc5609e6c5ecf9a0a479640fa8.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/b48b18dc5609e6c5ecf9a0a479640f