m/apps/2393970/extras/66019b8e5a664fcce2fb48c5a3eb6b2b.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/66019b8e5a664fcce2fb48c5a3eb6b2b.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/66019b8e5a664fcce2fb48c5a3eb6b2b.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● 10 randomly generated biomes:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, ruins, deserts, canyons, rainforests, snowfields… blending into one seamless, endless procedural world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/e4736420227b82e2f0c0008285eefa60.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/e4736420227b82e2f0c0008285eefa60.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/e4736420227b82e2f0c0008285eefa60.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/ccdf6597ef4971a194eb55e416f8bc76.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/ccdf6597ef4971a194eb55e416f8bc76.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/ccdf6597ef4971a194eb55e416f8bc76.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Wide variety of firearms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/00637b641330c408363e8b477bcac742.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/00637b641330c408363e8b477bcac742.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/00637b641330c408363e8b477bcac742.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Powerful and diverse traps</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/8def073a381106c2e9b69b83ebc2c840.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/8def073a381106c2e9b69b83ebc2c840.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/8def073a381106c2e9b69b83ebc2c840.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Intensely oppressive bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/7bc8903fa77412615d0b44d503c71e37.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/7bc8903fa77412615d0b44d503c71e37.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/7bc8903fa77412615d0b44d503c71e37.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Watch out for the night hordes — they run fast !”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/fcc0114e1643c653fe8e7b6c330e1de9.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/fcc0114e1643c653fe8e7b6c330e1de9.webm?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/fcc0114e1643c653fe8e7b6c330e1de9.mp4?t=1787190534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op is in full development… Coming soon.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zombie virus, airborne and with an incubation period lasting <strong>years</strong>, has suddenly swept across the entire world. Almost everyone is already infected. You are one of the rare few born immune to the pathogen. Do whatever it takes… <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Realistic physics collisions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outstanding hit feedback, and the armor no longer provides abstract defense values — instead, it physically covers the body surface to block incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393970/extras/dd4d0b684dc45b3ac429adbbd8f9223a.poster.avif?t=1787190534\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta